{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": null,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Commands/s",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(latkit_redis_commands_total{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "value"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Every command the agent saw on the watched port, including the ones with no latency of their own: a `+QUEUED` inside a `MULTI` and a `BLPOP` that waited are commands that happened (РR9/РR10). This is the number to compare against the server's own `INFO commandstats`."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p99 duration",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_command_duration_seconds_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "value"
        }
      ],
      "description": "First byte of the command to the last byte of the reply, measured on the server's host. Blocking commands and queued transaction members are *not* in it — a thirty-second `BLPOP` in here would be the p99 of the instance. This is the number `INFO commandstats` cannot give you: it reports a mean of execution time, and this is the tail as the network saw it."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error share",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(latkit_redis_errors_total{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(latkit_redis_commands_total{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "value"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Failed commands over all commands. Cluster redirects are deliberately not errors (РR7) — a resharding cluster answers `-MOVED` continuously and every client follows them; they have their own panel below."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "cmd=\"other\" share",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(latkit_redis_commands_total{proto=~\"$proto\",cmd=\"other\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(latkit_redis_commands_total{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "value"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Commands outside the closed table of docs/notes-redisproto.md. Unlike `route=\"other\"` on the HTTP dashboard this is not a cardinality warning — `cmd` is bounded by construction — it is an *ageing* one: a module (RedisJSON, RediSearch), a fork's own admin command, or a table that has not kept up with a new Redis release. A steady few per cent of `EVAL`-heavy traffic is normal; a step change is a version upgrade."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Command duration",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_command_duration_seconds_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_command_duration_seconds_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_command_duration_seconds_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The distribution `INFO commandstats` cannot produce: it holds a mean per command (`usec_per_call`) and nothing about the tail, and it measures execution *inside* the server. This is network-to-network on the server's host, so it includes the wait behind somebody else's slow command in the single-threaded event loop — which is exactly what an application feels and what the server cannot see."
    },
    {
