          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_pipeline_depth_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(latkit_redis_pipeline_depth_bucket{proto=~\"$proto\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How many commands arrived in the same syscall as this one, sampled per command (РR3). p50 = 1 means the clients do not batch and every command pays a round trip; a high p50 means a command's latency includes waiting behind its own batch, which is the client's choice and not the server's fault. The grid is octaves 1 … 256, the depth past which the in-flight queue drops units."
    },
