          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "db {{db}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The `SELECT`ed database number, tracked per connection by a state machine (РR5) — `INFO commandstats` is global for the instance and cannot split this. `db=\"?\"` is a connection the agent joined mid-stream, before any `SELECT` said which database it was on: an honest unknown rather than a `0` that would be a guess."
    },
