      "description": "The ACL user from `AUTH <user> <pass>` / `HELLO … AUTH` (РR6). The password is a separate array element and is never read, never stored and never shown. `--redis-user off` turns the label into a constant `-`. Together with the database panel this is the split an instance-wide `INFO` cannot give at all."
