          "legendFormat": "{{error}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The first token of the error reply (РR7): `WRONGTYPE` is a bug in the application, `NOSCRIPT` is a cache miss on `EVALSHA` and normal, `OOM` and `MISCONF` are the server refusing to work, `NOAUTH`/`NOPERM`/`WRONGPASS` are an ACL problem. The sentence after the symbol names the key and never leaves the agent; a symbol the vocabulary does not know is `other` — usually a Lua script's `redis.error_reply`."
    },
